+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |  Sort: supplier_cnt DESC NULLS FIRST, mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_brand ASC NULLS LAST, mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_type ASC NULLS LAST, mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_size ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   Projection: mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_brand, mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_type, mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_size, count(DISTINCT mysql.tpch_sf1.partsupp.ps_suppkey) AS supplier_cnt                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_brand, mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_type, mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_size]], aggr=[[count(DISTINCT mysql.tpch_sf1.partsupp.ps_suppkey)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |       Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_partkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.partsupp.ps_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |         Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.partsupp.ps_suppkey NOT IN (<subquery>)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |           Subquery:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |             Projection: mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier.s_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |               TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier, full_filters=[mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier.s_comment LIKE Utf8("%Customer%Complaints%")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |           TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.partsupp projection=[ps_partkey, ps_suppkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |         TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.part projection=[p_partkey, p_brand, p_type, p_size], full_filters=[mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_brand != Utf8("Brand#45"), mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_type NOT LIKE Utf8("MEDIUM POLISHED%"), mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_size IN ([Int64(49), Int64(14), Int64(23), Int64(45), Int64(19), Int64(3), Int64(36), Int64(9)])]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=mysql compute_context=host=benchmark-mysql.dataplatform.svc.cluster.local,port=3306,db=tpch_sf1,user=root base_sql=SELECT `p_brand`, `p_type`, `p_size`, count(DISTINCT `partsupp`.`ps_suppkey`) AS `supplier_cnt` FROM `tpch_sf1`.`partsupp` INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`part` ON ((`part`.`p_partkey` = `partsupp`.`ps_partkey`) AND (((`partsupp`.`ps_suppkey` NOT IN (SELECT `s_suppkey` FROM `tpch_sf1`.`supplier` WHERE `supplier`.`s_comment` LIKE '%Customer%Complaints%') AND (`part`.`p_brand` <> 'Brand#45')) AND `part`.`p_type` NOT LIKE 'MEDIUM POLISHED%') AND `part`.`p_size` IN (49, 14, 23, 45, 19, 3, 36, 9))) GROUP BY `part`.`p_brand`, `part`.`p_type`, `part`.`p_size` ORDER BY `supplier_cnt` DESC, `p_brand` ASC, `p_type` ASC, `p_size` ASC |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
